  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "*siiigh*<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002A007300690069006900670068002A001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680021002000100002010000000021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey Lida, what’s wrong?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006500790020004C006900640061002C0020007700680061007420190073002000770072006F006E0067003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That was a serious sigh",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061007400200077006100730020006100200073006500720069006F00750073002000730069006700680000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, don’t mind me! Just thinkin’ some thoughts.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLike about Ansha! Isn’t she impressive? She made\nher Rayquaza dreams come true...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’mon, what’s the matter?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00432019006D006F006E002C002000770068006100742019007300200074006800650020006D00610074007400650072003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Really, you can tell me",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005200650061006C006C0079002C00200079006F0075002000630061006E002000740065006C006C0020006D00650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Heh. Yeah...well...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650068002E00200059006500610068002E002E002E00770065006C006C002E002E002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I guess I’m just feeling...behind.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nRemember what I told you about the friend I was\nrooming with when I first moved here? How she<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntried out for a talent agency and got in?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 181
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then there’s my brother—well, half brother.\nWe’ve got different moms.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065006E002000740068006500720065201900730020006D0079002000620072006F0074006800650072201400770065006C006C002C002000680061006C0066002000620072006F0074006800650072002E000A0057006520190076006500200067006F007400200064006900660066006500720065006E00740020006D006F006D0073002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What about him?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074002000610062006F00750074002000680069006D003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What’s he like?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074201900730020006800650020006C0069006B0065003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, I’ve never met him or talked to him...but his\nname’s Tierno, and he’s a successful dancer.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "All these people in my orbit are achieving their\ndreams, and it’s like...how come I’m not?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s OK—you’re doing great",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490074201900730020004F004B20140079006F007520190072006500200064006F0069006E00670020006700720065006100740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’ve got nothing to prove",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007520190076006500200067006F00740020006E006F007400680069006E006700200074006F002000700072006F007600650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thanks for saying that. But also, like...you’re a\npretty great Trainer, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nConfidence comes more naturally when you’re\nalready doing well, y’know?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 157
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm. But maybe...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D006D002E00200042007500740020006D0061007900620065002E002E002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Would you do me a favor and battle with me,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI think a good battle would help me feel more sure\nof myself.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 123
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll be at my practice spot. See you there!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C0020006200650020006100740020006D0079002000700072006100630074006900630065002000730070006F0074002E002000530065006500200079006F00750020007400680065007200650021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>. Ready to battle?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650079002C00200010000201000000002E00200052006500610064007900200074006F00200062006100740074006C0065003F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah, let’s do it!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500610068002C0020006C006500742019007300200064006F00200069007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gimme a sec",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470069006D006D00650020006100200073006500630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "All right! Ugh, I’m all nervous...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C00200072006900670068007400210020005500670068002C002000492019006D00200061006C006C0020006E006500720076006F00750073002E002E002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK! Here goes!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F004B00210020004800650072006500200067006F006500730021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Here goes, Starmie! Shine like the star you are!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650072006500200067006F00650073002C00200053007400610072006D0069006500210020005300680069006E00650020006C0069006B006500200074006800650020007300740061007200200079006F0075002000610072006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lidaaa! That ruuuled!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0069006400610061006100210020005400680061007400200072007500750075006C00650064002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Korrina?! How long have you been there?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004B006F007200720069006E0061003F002100200048006F00770020006C006F006E00670020006800610076006500200079006F00750020006200650065006E002000740068006500720065003F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Since right about when your battle started!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530069006E00630065002000720069006700680074002000610062006F007500740020007700680065006E00200079006F0075007200200062006100740074006C006500200073007400610072007400650064002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Why WERE you two battling, anyway?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800790020005700450052004500200079006F0075002000740077006F00200062006100740074006C0069006E0067002C00200061006E0079007700610079003F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>I’ve been feeling stressed lately. I thought a good\nbattle with <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> might help<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nme<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nget<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmy<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ngroove back.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 17,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 123
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y’know what I think, Lida? You’re amazing!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00592019006B006E006F007700200077006800610074002000490020007400680069006E006B002C0020004C006900640061003F00200059006F007520190072006500200061006D0061007A0069006E0067002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Huh?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800750068003F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re part of Team MZ—the crew that saved all\nof Lumiose!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 3824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075201900720065002000700061007200740020006F00660020005400650061006D0020004D005A2014007400680065002000630072006500770020007400680061007400200073006100760065006400200061006C006C000A006F00660020004C0075006D0069006F00730065002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>If you can hang with someone as crazy strong as\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nyou<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nMUST<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbe<U+0010><U+0001>븀\namazing!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 16,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 3952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Plus, you’ve got something that’s all your own—\nyour dancing! You and Starmie move like you<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nshare one mind!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 115
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wow, Korrina... That means a lot.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006F0077002C0020004B006F007200720069006E0061002E002E002E002000540068006100740020006D00650061006E0073002000610020006C006F0074002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That stress you’re talking about, Lida? Reminds\nme of when I first took up the mantle of Mega<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nEvolution successor...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 124
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I had to learn so much about Mega Evolution!\nThere’s STILL so much I don’t know!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And eventually there’ll be another successor, so I\nhave to figure out what to pass on to them...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 4872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I decided to focus on what I know for sure I\ncan do. That’s helped me keep moving forward.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s helpful to hear. Thank you, Korrina.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061007420190073002000680065006C007000660075006C00200074006F00200068006500610072002E0020005400680061006E006B00200079006F0075002C0020004B006F007200720069006E0061002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>You too, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>—you’re a\ngood<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfriend.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nThank you!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 13,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0600000059006F007500200074006F006F002C0020001000020100000020140079006F007520190072006500200061000A0067006F006F006400100001BE00000A0066007200690065006E0064002E00100001BE00000A005400680061006E006B00200079006F00750021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Glad I could help! Now I can go back to worrying\nabout my own problem.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What problem’s that?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074002000700072006F0062006C0065006D2019007300200074006800610074003F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mega Evolution is even more mysterious to me\nnow than when I first started!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI wish someone would just tell me its deal!!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 5700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 129
    }
  ],
